{"id":"word:hebrew:H2677","type":"word","title":"חֵצִי","subtitle":"H2677 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"the half or middle","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to חֵצִי (H2677) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 123 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"חֵצִי (chêtsîy) means the half or middle First listed occurrence: 1Chr 5 18."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"חֵצִי","transliteration":"chêtsîy","pronunciation":"khay-tsee'","strong":"H2677","lemmaId":"hebrew:H2677","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["וַ/חֲצִ֣י","חֲצִ֥י","חֲצִ֣י","חֲצִ֖י","וָ/חֵ֖צִי"],"morphs":[["HNcmsc",31],["HC/Ncmsc",29],["HC/Ncmsa",15],["HR/Ncmsc",14],["HC/R/Ncmsc",10],["HNcmsc/Sp3ms",5],["HRd/Ncmsa",3],["HTd/Ncmsa",3],["HC/Ncmsc/Sp3mp",3],["HC/Td/Ncmsa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"the half or middle","usage":"half, middle, mid(-night), midst, part, two parts.","full":"H2677. chatsi חֲצִי 123 noun masculine Num 12:12 half (Late Hebrew id. ; Phoenician חצי ; on formative see Lag BN 113 ) — absolute חֲצִי 1Kin 3:25 (twice in verse) + 3t.; הַחֵ֑צִי 10:7 , compare 16:21 ; וָחֵ֔צִי Ezek 40:42 ; וָחֵצִי Dan 12:7 13 t. (usually with Pashta or Tiphcha), compare בַּחֵ֖צִי 2Sam 10:4 ; 1Chr 19:4 ; construct חֲצִי Exod 12:29 84t.; suffix חֶצְיוֺ 38:4 7 t. + Josh 8:33 וְהַחֶצְיוֺ (but article suspicious. see Ges § 127 R 3, 4); חֶצְיָהּ Nehemiah 3:38; חֶצְיֵנוּ 2Sam 18:3 ; חֶצְיָם Zech 14:8 (twice in verse) + 2t. — 1 half of anything: — blood of offering Exod 24:6 (twice in verse) (JE), beard 2Sam 10:4 , a hin Num 15:9-10 , 28:14 (P); curtain Exod 26:12 (P); week ׳ח השׁבוע Dan 9:27 etc.; ׳ח אַמָּה half a cubit Exod 26:16 ; 36:21 (P) +; especially ׳ח שׁבט half a tribe Num 32:33 ; 34:13-14 , 15 (P) +; half of people 2Sam 18:3 ; 19:41 ; 1Kin 16:21 (3 t. in verse) +, etc. so ׳ח הַמְּנֻחוֺת 1Chr 2:52 and ׳ח הַמָּנַחְתִּי 2:54 (see Be and מָנַחַת below נוח ). — On כבחצי 1Sam 14:4 see We Dr. 2 middle ׳ח הלילה Exod 12:29 (J) midnight , so Judg 16:3 (twice in verse); Ruth 3:8 ; of garments 2Sam 10:4 ; 1Chr 19:4 ; altar Exod 27:5 ; of the Mt. of Olives Zech 14:4 ; ׳ח יָמַי Psa 102:25 the midst of my days (when they are but half done), Jer 17:11 .","rootNote":"from 2673 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 5 18","keyReferences":["1Chr 5 18","1Chr 5 23","1Chr 5 26","1Chr 6 46","1Chr 6 56","1Chr 12 32","1Chr 12 38","1Chr 19 4"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":123,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 5 18","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":18,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/חֲצִ֥י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"1Chr 5 23","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲצִי֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"1Chr 5 26","book":"1Chr","chapter":5,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/לַ/חֲצִ֖י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/R/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"1Chr 6 46","book":"1Chr","chapter":6,"verse":46,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲצִ֧י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"1Chr 6 56","book":"1Chr","chapter":6,"verse":56,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲצִי֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"1Chr 12 32","book":"1Chr","chapter":12,"verse":32,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/מֵ/חֲצִי֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/R/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"1Chr 12 38","book":"1Chr","chapter":12,"verse":38,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/חֲצִ֣י","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"1Chr 19 4","book":"1Chr","chapter":19,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/חֵ֖צִי","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 26 32","book":"1Chr","chapter":26,"verse":32,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/חֲצִי֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"1Chr 27 20","book":"1Chr","chapter":27,"verse":20,"englishText":"","sou